Dizziness can definitely be related to blood pressure, medications, or heart rhythm. To investigate this, consider asking:
* *"I've been experiencing recent dizziness. Could this be a side effect of my Lisinopril (blood pressure medication) or Atorvastatin?"*
* *"Could my dizziness be related to my atrial fibrillation, even though my ECG last month was normal?"*
